    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--1\"><div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p>A giant lizard can be ridden or used as a draft animal. Lizardfolk also keep them as pets, and subterranean giant lizards are used as mounts and pack animals by drow, duergar, and other Underdark dwellers.</p><div class=\"rd__b-special rd__b-inset\" data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Variant: Giant Lizard Traits\"><h4 class=\"rd__h rd__h--2-inset\" data-title-index=\"1\"> <span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Variant: Giant Lizard Traits</span><span class=\"ve-flex-vh-center\"></span></h4> <p>Some giant lizards have one or both of the following traits.</p><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Hold Breath\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"rd__h rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"2\"> <span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Hold Breath.</span></span> The lizard can hold its breath for 15 minutes. (A lizard that has this trait also has a swimming speed of 30 feet.)</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Spider Climb\" class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"rd__h rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"3\"> <span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Spider Climb.</span></span> The lizard can climb difficult surfaces, including upside down on ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.</p></div></div></div></div>",
        "public": ""
      },
